   "top": 40,
   "h": 76,
   "style": "a2823819",
   "text": "RFC: Proxy IP TokenBucket v2（去除 terminal_id 信任边界"
  },
  {
   "slot": 2,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 137,
   "h": 52,
   "style": "87e6e49e",
   "text": "状态: Draft（增量修订） 目标文件: .legion/tasks/vendor-token"
  },
  {
   "slot": 3,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 229,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "34d9d9cb",
   "text": "摘要 / 动机§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 4,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 271,
   "h": 84,
   "style": "6c5775dd",
   "text": "本次修订收敛 HTTPProxy 的信任模型：terminal_id 不再被视为稳定身份，也不得"
  },
  {
   "slot": 5,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 373,
   "h": 28,
   "style": "051e3124",
   "text": "动机有三点："
  },
  {
   "slot": 6,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 419,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "7f5f5b92",
   "text": "terminal_id 不稳定，继续把它当作 trust boundary 会导致配置漂移、误拒"
  },
  {
   "slot": 7,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 477,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "91943ae2",
   "text": "当前限流与实际出口已经以 ip 为核心维度；继续把 terminal_id 混入 helper "
  },
  {
   "slot": 8,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 536,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "1f8e5732",
   "text": "用户最新要求已经明确：同一 host 网络内所有 terminal 默认互信，因此信任边界应上移"
  },
  {
   "slot": 9,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 610,
   "h": 56,
   "style": "2a3f3b4c",
   "text": "结论：本 RFC 将 v2 方案改为“host 内默认互信 + IP 维度选路/限流”，并显式删"
  },
  {
   "slot": 10,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 707,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "31d9d512",
   "text": "目标与非目标§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 11,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 763,
   "h": 23,
   "style": "8541921c",
   "text": "目标§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 12,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 795,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "b6334688",
   "text": "代理模式下，helper MUST 仅基于同 host 网络中可见的 HTTPProxy 服务、"
  },
  {
   "slot": 13,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 854,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "e13fbde3",
   "text": "helper MUST 不再读取、解析、缓存或依赖 TRUSTED_HTTP_PROXY_TER"
  },
  {
   "slot": 14,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 882,
   "h": 78,
   "style": "5b5a46a3",
   "text": "libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts 内所有导出的 H"
  },
  {
   "slot": 15,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 963,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "c924201b",
   "text": "helper 返回值 MUST 从 { ip, terminalId, bucketKey } "
  },
  {
   "slot": 16,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 991,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "c61b070e",
   "text": "vendor 请求路由 MUST 只写入 labels.ip，MUST NOT 再写入 labe"
  },
  {
   "slot": 17,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1019,
   "h": 52,
   "style": "03ce3e04",
   "text": "apps/http-proxy 服务注册 MUST 删除 labels.terminal_id；"
  },
  {
   "slot": 18,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1073,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "24d4888c",
   "text": "同一 host 网络内多个 terminal 共享同一出口 IP 时，MUST 视为同一个限流/"
  },
  {
   "slot": 19,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1104,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "7e788c12",
   "text": "RFC 必须明确回答：后续不应继续在请求 labels 或 helper 返回值中使用 term"
  },
  {
   "slot": 20,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 1188,
   "h": 23,
   "style": "84419089",
   "text": "非目标§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 21,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1220,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "7e0f5f75",
   "text": "不修改 tokenBucket 底层算法、acquireSync 语义和 semaphore 实"
  },
  {
   "slot": 22,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1249,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "ec58e9fa",
   "text": "不改造协议层 terminal_id 作为消息寻址字段的既有职责。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 23,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1279,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "2de3a141",
   "text": "不在本次 scope 内引入新的 host 级鉴权、mTLS 或网络分区机制。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 24,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1310,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "13171c33",
   "text": "不扩大到所有 vendor 的立即实现；本次落地范围仍以 http-services、http-"
  },
  {
   "slot": 25,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 1407,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "2dd9cec6",
   "text": "定义§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 26,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1450,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "c8fd5cad",
   "text": "Host 网络: 同一个 Terminal Host 视图内可见、可被当前 terminal 枚"
