  {
   "slot": 27,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1480,
   "h": 52,
   "style": "eceac3d3",
   "text": "HTTPProxy 候选: 同 host 网络内声明了 HTTPProxy 服务，且 tags."
  },
  {
   "slot": 28,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1535,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "e1ef5a26",
   "text": "IP 等价类: 具有相同 tags.ip 的一个或多个 HTTPProxy terminal；调"
  },
  {
   "slot": 29,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1593,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "d6e10a4e",
   "text": "BaseKey: vendor 现有的限流基键。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 30,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1624,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "11ff88fe",
   "text": "BucketKey: encodePath([baseKey, ip])。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 31,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1652,
   "h": 26,
   "style": "8e5e9994",
   "text": "Stage: 错误归属阶段，取值 {pool|acquire|route|request}。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 32,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 1719,
   "h": 29,
   "style": "32d9d6a5",
   "text": "现状与问题§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 33,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 1761,
   "h": 28,
   "style": "ab7d8ccb",
   "text": "基于当前代码与任务上下文，可确认以下现状："
  },
  {
   "slot": 34,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1807,
   "h": 52,
   "style": "d0f29305",
   "text": "libraries/http-services/src/proxy-ip.ts 通过 TRUST"
  },
  {
   "slot": 35,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1861,
   "h": 52,
   "style": "11cee382",
   "text": "apps/http-proxy/src/index.ts 会把 labels.terminal_"
  },
  {
   "slot": 36,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 1916,
   "h": 57,
   "style": "033743ab",
   "text": "apps/vendor-binance/src/api/client.ts 在代理模式下把 { "
